  "question": "Which gallery is nearest along the way toward Veteran Park, Fountain Valley, CA from Aquatic Zoo Tropical Fish, Thousand Oaks, CA?",
  "sql": "WITH\n    angle AS (SELECT degrees(ST_Azimuth(ST_GeomFromText('POINT (-118.840161 34.172588)',4326)::geography, ST_GeomFromText('POINT (-117.950067 33.707154)',4326)::geography)) AS value)\nSELECT * FROM pois,angle\nWHERE tourism = 'gallery'\nAND (degrees(ST_Azimuth(ST_GeomFromText('POINT (-118.840161 34.172588)',4326)::geography, pois.geometry)) BETWEEN angle.value - 22.5 AND angle.value + 22.5)\nORDER BY pois.geometry <-> ST_GeomFromText('POINT (-118.840161 34.172588)',4326)::geography ASC\nLIMIT 1;\n",
